WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.542
Influencer isn't just another interruptive channel, for three reasons.

00:00:04.592 --> 00:00:05.757
Peer validation,

00:00:05.807 --> 00:00:06.912
algorithmic trust,

00:00:06.962 --> 00:00:08.292
and cultural resonance,

00:00:08.342 --> 00:00:12.202
worth about two hundred and forty-six percent more than standard attention.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:13.970
A creator reviews a serum.

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:17.272
A viewer thinks, she's just like me.

00:00:17.322 --> 00:00:19.029
Then she searches it on TikTok,

00:00:19.079 --> 00:00:19.879
Google,

00:00:19.775 --> 00:00:20.575
even an AI assistant,

00:00:20.023 --> 00:00:22.909
and finds what creators said.

00:00:22.959 --> 00:00:25.154
Social is now search.

00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:27.091
Use it like this:

00:00:27.141 --> 00:00:28.871
pick the reason that serves your goal,

00:00:28.921 --> 00:00:31.393
and justify the spend with it.
